{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111575","id":2908848489,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6tYYFp","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111575","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111575.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111575.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111575","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111575/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111575/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111575/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/23d1ebf014538a0c1fcc345d13ab65ec1ce418ee","number":111575,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"GDScript: Fix indentation level check when using multi-line lambdas within nested brackets","user":{"login":"shoonee","id":55113941,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MTEzOTQx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55113941?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoonee","html_url":"https://github.com/shoonee","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoonee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoonee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoonee/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoonee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoonee/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoonee/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoonee/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoonee/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoonee/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/guidelines/code_style.html\r\n-->\r\n\r\n- Fixes #71109\r\n- Fixes #97204\r\n- Fixes #106692\r\n- Fixes #109319\r\n\r\n## Summary\r\n\r\nPreviously, using a multi-line lambda within nested brackets would require the following token outside the lambda body to either have less indentation as the outermost bracket indentation or have the same or more indentation as the lambda's body.\r\n\r\nGDScript seems to ignore indentation levels when in brackets anyway, so this change extends that flexibility for multi-line lambdas as well. All the lines in the lambda body still needs to be at the same indentation to be considered part of the lambda, though.\r\n\r\n## Examples\r\n\r\nThe following code snippet errors on `master`:\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nfunc test():\r\n\t(\r\n\t\t(\r\n\t\t\tfunc():\r\n\t\t\t\tpass  # Parse Error: Unindent doesn't match the previous indentation level.\r\n\t\t) # <-- this bracket has bad indentation for some reason\r\n\t).call()\r\n\r\n\t(\r\n\t\t(\r\n\t\t\tfunc():\r\n\t\t\t\tpass  # Parse Error: Unindent doesn't match the previous indentation level.\r\n\t\t\t) # <-- this bracket also has bad indentation\r\n\t).call()\r\n```\r\nThis PR removes the above errors.\r\n\r\nFor completeness, the following snippet doesn't error on `master`:\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nfunc test():\r\n\t(\r\n\t\t(\r\n\t\t\tfunc():\r\n\t\t\t\tpass\r\n) # <-- this bracket is okay\r\n\t).call()\r\n\r\n\t(\r\n\t\t(\r\n\t\t\tfunc():\r\n\t\t\t\tpass\r\n\t) # <-- this bracket is also okay\r\n\t).call()\r\n\r\n\t(\r\n\t\t(\r\n\t\t\tfunc():\r\n\t\t\t\tpass\r\n\t\t\t\t) # <-- this bracket is okay too\r\n\t).call()\r\n\r\n\t(\r\n\t\t(\r\n\t\t\tfunc():\r\n\t\t\t\tpass\r\n\t\t\t\t\t) # <-- so is this one\r\n\t).call()\r\n```\r\n\r\nAlso see the test cases added in `modules/gdscript/tests/scripts/parser/features/lambda_indentation.gd`, which all fail to be parsed by the `master` branch.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5793,"closed_issues"